            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Aeon Mall Hà Đông",
            "review_text": "Bích Ngọc K\n1 contribution\n0\nBeautiful, unique space, delicious food, will come back\nSep 2026 • Friends\nThe Pizza 4P's space at AEON Mall Ha Dong is generally beautiful, modern, and quite comfortable. I like how the quán uses warm lighting and wooden furniture, so even though it's in a shopping center, it creates a cozy feeling, not too \"industrial.\" An open kitchen is also a plus because customers can see the staff making the pizza. However, during rush hour, the quán was quite crowded and a bit noisy, and the distance between some tables did not provide much privacy.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten October 2, 2026",
